Caddy web server (www/caddy) built with xcaddy and these plugins:

- caddy-l4 (layer 4 TCP/UDP routing, SNI/SSH/... multiplexing)
- caddy-dynamicdns (dynamic DNS updates)
- caddy-ratelimit (HTTP rate limiting)
- caddy-dns/cloudflare (DNS challenge and dynamic DNS provider)
- wstunnel-go pkg/caddy (WebSocket/HTTP2 tunnel server)

Configuration drop-ins are read from etc/caddy/Caddyfile.d/*.caddyfile.
Examples for each module are installed in share/examples/caddy-custom.
